# Cloudflare Pages — Hugo static site routing
# Hugo generates directory-style URLs: /docs/foo/ → public/docs/foo/index.html
# Without this file, Cloudflare's SPA default rewrites all 404s to index.html (the homepage).
# This file disables that by mapping 404s to our own 404 page instead.

/404   /404.html  200

# Catch-all: serve 404 page (not index.html) for any path that doesn't exist
/*     /404.html  404
